    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious three bedroom bungalow with Garage on 0.43Ha site\r\nComprising: Entrance Hall - Lounge – Kitchen – Utility Room, 3 Bedrooms (Master Bedroom Ensuite) and Family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nLocated just 800 yards from the popular village of Raharney and its amenities including Primary School, Raharney GAA club, Derrymore Springs, Royal Canal Greenway at nearby Thomastown.\r\nThe village is also served by Bus Eireann (Navan-Athlone) and secondary school bus route.\r\nAnd is 1 mile from Killucan and 365 miles from Dublin.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended of this super family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Close to Raharney village, primary school & Gaa grounds - 800yards\r\nBus Eireann service 190 to and from Mullingar, Navan & Athlone\r\n1 mile from Killucan\r\n35 miles from Dublin\r\nMains water\r\nPrivate septic tank system\r\nGarage 30sqm\r\nStore 20sqm"
      },
      {
